      441         tt-trn.cli-type        FORMAT "X(3)":U         column-label "Тип"
      442         tt-trn.cli-code        FORMAT ">>>>9":U        column-label "Код"
      443         tt-trn.cli-name        FORMAT "X(20)":U        column-label "Поставщика"
      444       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 100 BY 6.75 EXPANDABLE.
      445   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      446        B-Cancel AT ROW 1.04 COL 1
      447        B-fo AT ROW 1.04 COL 16.5
      448        B-Help AT ROW 1.04 COL 86.5
      449        BROWSE-4 AT ROW 2.25 COL 1
      450        BROWSE-3 AT ROW 9.46 COL 1
      451        SPACE(0.37) SKIP(0.16)
      452       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      453            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      454            TITLE "Накладные по сгенеренным ФО для разбора"
      455            CANCEL-BUTTON B-Cancel.
      456   ASSIGN
      457          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      458          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      459   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      460   DO:
      461     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
      462   END.
